# Content design

Write for someone who wants to understand or control their home quickly. Use familiar household words, clear actions and precise states.


## Use the complete writing guide

The [writing guide for home automation](../content/index.html) is the canonical source for new and revised copy. It includes actions and states, errors and alerts, instructions, inclusive language, numbers, accessible formats and editorial review. This page remains a short introduction in the Writing guide section and preserves its existing URL; resolve detail through the relevant writing-guide rule.


